cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ANTS, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ANTS: A Neutron Transport Solution"
abstract: >-
  ANTS solves the neutron transport equation with the discrete ordinates
  (S_N) method for fixed source, criticality, and time-dependent problems in
  one and two dimensions, and fixed source problems in three dimensions. It
  is written in Cython and parallelized with OpenMP.
authors:
